⚡️🇮🇷🇸🇦 Navigation in the Strait of Hormuz and the Bab-el-Mandeb Strait has decreased, following an attack on a Saudi oil tanker.

According to Reuters, only one (1) ship carrying goods passed throught the Bab-El-Mandab strait today, compared to twenty (20) ships yesterday.

